%% UC03 Receive a returned item (damaged branch opens a maintenance case)
sequenceDiagram
  autonumber
  actor CU as Custodian
  participant C as Loan<br/>Controller
  participant S as LoanService
  participant R as Loan<br/>Repository
  participant M as Maintenance<br/>Service
  participant DB as PostgreSQL
  participant EV as Event<br/>Publisher
  CU->>C: POST /loans/{id}/return<br/>{expectedVersion, condition, note}
  C->>S: receive(loanId, version, condition, note)
  Note over S: @PreAuthorize CUSTODIAN<br/>@Transactional, fixed lock order
  S->>R: lockEquipment()
  R->>DB: SELECT … FOR UPDATE
  S->>R: lockReservationReference(), lockLoan()
  S->>S: status ACTIVE, version matches?
  alt stale or already returned
    S-->>C: LoanConflictException 409
  end
  S->>R: returnLoan(…, expectedVersion)
  R->>DB: UPDATE loan … WHERE version = ?
  opt condition = DAMAGED
    S->>M: reportFault(…, PHYSICAL_DAMAGE, HIGH)
    M->>DB: INSERT maintenance_case
    M-->>S: caseId
  end
  S->>S: EquipmentLoanState.afterReturn()
  S->>R: setEquipment(), audit(LOAN_RETURN)
  S->>EV: LoanEvent RETURNED
  Note over S,DB: COMMIT
  S-->>C: LoanView
  C-->>CU: 200 OK
